rooms_desc ({"This is a long hallway leading away from the enterance towardsthe inner living quarters.  The main thing that strikes you about it, isit is lined with bookshelves, all crammed full with books.  You get the idea that the Lady Cookie like to read.  Also, there are several exoticplants, the likes of which you have never seen before.  There are a fewAfrican wall hangings which finishes the room prefectly.You feel peaceful as you wander aimlessly to the next room....","You walk into a large spacious Biscuit Barrel.  The walls are made ofold oak and still have the air and feel of the trees from which theywere made.  The room although sparse with furniture, is filled withstrange and exotic biscuits from all around the world.  The walls areladen with paintings of all the Cookie's, whom can be trace back to theDawn of Time.  There are numerous bookshelves filling the walls, all ofwhich are stacked full of different books on interesting topics.  Thetables are littered with open scrolls, parchments, and maps, which leaves you thinking that she must be planning something.As the thought enters your head, you suddenly feel as though you'renot alone......just then Something steps into view, making you silentwith fear.  Whatever IT is, it starts towards you....","This is Jem's room. As you look around you notice the walls aremade from old stone.  Each stone hand cut from the oldest Dwarfquarry's.  The center of the north wall is dominated by a largemarble fireplace. It has a chearful, dancing fire burning in it,an you can hear it peacefully crackling. On the east wall is a very large window, which allows to to look out into Cookie'sgarden.  It is framed by large red velvet curtains, which aretied back with lengths of golden cord.  Just under the window there is an aged oak window seat, with many cushions scatteredover it. As you continue looking, you see the floor has beenpolished, and you can still smell the bee's wax in the air.It has been covered in the finest Persian rugs known to man.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"The Hallway","Cookie's Biscuit Barrel","Jem's room","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
